<view class="page">
  <text class="eyebrow">管理中心</text><text class="title">把能做什么、改过什么都说清楚</text><text class="subtitle">仅负责人可处理绑定、权限、审计、商品状态与学生档案。</text>
  <view wx:if="{{state.role === 'guardian'}}" class="card"><text class="form-label">申请绑定孩子</text><input class="input" placeholder="孩子姓名或辅导班提供的邀请码姓名" value="{{bindingStudent}}" data-field="bindingStudent" bindinput="input" /><input class="input" placeholder="关系，例如：母亲" value="{{bindingRelation}}" data-field="bindingRelation" bindinput="input" /><button class="primary submit" bindtap="applyBinding">提交绑定申请</button><text class="muted">审核通过前，系统不会开放其他孩子的数据。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{state.role === 'staff'}}" class="empty">老师可处理作业、状态、提醒、积分奖励、错题和现场兑换；绑定与权限管理仅负责人可操作。</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <scroll-view scroll-x class="chip-row"><button class="chip {{section === 'students' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-section="students" bindtap="chooseSection">学员绑定</button><button class="chip {{section === 'permissions' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-section="permissions" bindtap="chooseSection">角色权限</button><button class="chip {{section === 'audit' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-section="audit" bindtap="chooseSection">操作审计</button></scroll-view>
    <block wx:if="{{section === 'students'}}"><view class="section-title"><text>待审核绑定</text></view><view wx:if="{{!bindings.length}}" class="empty">暂无绑定申请。</view><view wx:for="{{bindings}}" wx:key="id" class="card binding"><view><text>{{item.guardian}}</text><text>申请绑定 {{item.student}} · {{item.relation}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.status === '待审核'}}"><button class="soft" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="已通过" bindtap="review">通过</button><button class="text-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="已拒绝" bindtap="review">拒绝</button></view><text wx:else class="status">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="card"><text class="form-label">新增学生档案</text><input class="input" placeholder="学生姓名" value="{{studentName}}" data-field="studentName" bindinput="input" /><input class="input" placeholder="年级，例如：三年级" value="{{studentGrade}}" data-field="studentGrade" bindinput="input" /><button class="primary submit" bindtap="addStudent">新增学生</button></view><view class="section-title"><text>学生档案</text></view><view wx:for="{{students}}" wx:key="id" class="card binding"><view><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.grade}}</text><text>家长：{{item.guardiansText}} · {{item.active ? '正常' : '已停用'}}</text></view><button class="soft" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleStudent">{{item.active ? '停用' : '启用'}}</button></view></block>
    <block wx:if="{{section === 'permissions'}}"><view wx:for="{{permissionRows}}" wx:key="name" class="card permission"><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.detail}}</text></view><text>{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="card security"><text>安全说明</text><text>当前演示版用角色切换展示权限；正式上线必须在云函数内再次校验角色与学生绑定，不能仅隐藏按钮。</text></view></block>
    <block wx:if="{{section === 'audit'}}"><view wx:for="{{audit}}" wx:key="id" class="card audit"><text>{{item.at}}</text><view><text>{{item.actor}} · {{item.action}}</text><text>{{item.target}}：{{item.detail}}</text></view></view></block>
  </block>
</view>
